    728  f0f3							; Store ORDER is cycle-critical (thin-yellow-line fix, 2026-10-01): the
    729  f0f3							; stores land mid-visible (advance block then these pairs), so on the
    730  f0f3							; row1→row2 band-transition line the left half must keep the OLD band's
    731  f0f3							; PF+color while the right half may show the NEW band. Write cycles
    732  f0f3							; (cN = CPU cycles on the setup line, x = pixel at 4x, HBLANK ends c22.7):
    733  f0f3							;   PF0 w c34 x136 | PF1 w c41 x222 | COLUPF w c48 x296 |
    734  f0f3							;   COLUP1 w c51 x332 (D6 M1 band color — AFTER the left half, so the
    735  f0f3							;     transition line keeps the OLD band's M1/P1 color on the left, same
    736  f0f3							;     rule as COLUPF) |
