    930  f166							; --- Advance to next tile row (X clobbered by object section: reload) ---
    931  f166							; Phase C vcrunch shutter: while the band's slice run is live
    932  f166							; (RowIdx == VcrBand, VcrNext in 1..4) the row does NOT advance — the
    933  f166							; tail hands the setup line to RowSlice, which renders the next
    934  f166							; sub-slice of the shutter band and jumps to SliceReentry. Slice path
    935  f166							; ≈59c + jmp 3c = 62c from the previous WSYNC (<=73 => single line);
