    937  f166							; idle marker so a title-stomp VcrBand=0 coincidences cannot slice)
    938  f166							; — measured segments stay under the 152c double-line ceiling.
    939  f166							; RowSlice lives in the $FBD0 fill hole (below). TAIL JMP, not jsr:
    940  f166							; the slice loop would otherwise push 4 returns per frame that the
    941  f166							; jmp re-entry never pops (stack decay — F6-hotspot family), and the
    942  f166							; old jsr + rts + lda/sta GRP0 + jmp tail was +14c on the first body
    943  f166							; line after each slice setup (82c measured; >=74 = stall line).
    944  f166							; SP: ZERO extra dips at kernel depth (jsr removed) — sim_bomb_fuse
    945  f166							; gate (gameplay min SP >= $F8) can only improve.
    946  f166							; SliceReentry is a GLOBAL label: .Line is local to CaveKernelRow's
