   1970  f651							; ==============================================================================
   1971  f651							; SelectActiveObject — choose the single GRP1 object to draw this frame.
   1972  f651							; The TIA has one GRP1 sprite, so objects flicker by rotating slots each frame.
   1973  f651							; Sets ObjBase, ActiveObjectX, ActiveObjectY, ObjTop, COLUP1.
   1974  f651							; Slot count (enemies + miner?) lives in Temp for this VBLANK only.
   1975  f651							; Bomb fuse (state=1): low-priority — bomb only when (BombTimer&3)==0
   1976  f651							; (~15 Hz); other frames normal miner/enemy rotation (FlickerFrame alone).
   1977  f651							; One GRP1: cannot draw bomb + entity same frame.
   1978  f651							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1979  f651				   SelectActiveObject
   1980  f651		       e6 b4		      inc	FlickerFrame	; advance every frame (bomb + enemy paths)
   1981  f653							; --- Bomb fuse (state=1): 1 of 4 frames = bomb (enemies keep priority) ---
