   2374  f837							; (177B slack before the $F8DD sprite pin); pre-pad END headroom is 1B but
   2375  f837							; this region is upstream of the pin, so it costs nothing at $FC67.
   2376  f837							; KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit (no per-key storage).
   2377  f837							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
