   2486  f926							; Boxes are in tile coordinates (col 0-19, row 0-2); the walk tests the
   2487  f926							; PF0/1/2Buf cell bits directly (cell_collision_plan 2.1) — no rect cache,
   2488  f926							; no rect-count limit. The playfield is reflected, so right-half display
   2489  f926							; cols mirror via 39-col IN THE PROLOGUE (walk sees left-half only).
   2490  f926							; Returns C=0 if clear, C=1 if blocked.
   2491  f926				   PlayerHitsMap
