   2798  fb37							; RowSlice — Phase C vcrunch shutter: render ONE sub-slice of the shutter
   2799  fb37							; band (VcrBand=1, middle band — specials rule 2026-10-14).
   2800  fb37							; jsr-entered from the kernel row-advance (rts back, then `jmp .Line` —
   2801  fb37							; DASM has no external-local syntax so the loop re-entry stays in-scope)
   2802  fb37							; while RowIdx == VcrBand and VcrNext in 1..4. Replaces the .Row setup
   2803  fb37							; line for slices 1-4 (slice0 ran via the kernel-entry .Row with the
   2804  fb37							; derived 8-line count):
   2805  fb37							;   ranges   [0,9) [9,18) [18,31) [31,40) [40,49)  = 5 setups + 44 bodies
   2806  fb37							;	      = 49 WSYNCs — exactly band0's original count (wall unchanged).
   2807  fb37							; ENABL/ENAM1 = per-slice state gates (ball $ff/$00, left-mirror M1
   2808  fb37							; $02/$00 — Step 4) — written early on the setup line (well before the
   2809  fb37							; block's ball pixels, so no transition seam); PF/palette persist from
   2810  fb37							; .Row's band setup. Setup line WSYNCS (visible) but does NOT enter .Line —
   2811  fb37							; Y (running A0) must still advance so the next .Line pass indexes the
   2812  fb37							; correct sprite row (bug: skipped iny delayed GRP0 3 lines when armed).
   2813  fb37							; .Line inherits Y = A0+1 exactly as after a body WSYNC.
   2814  fb37							; Cycles: tail ≈19 + body ≈36 + jsr/rts 12 ≈ 67-71 from the previous
   2815  fb37							; WSYNC (<= 76 → the setup line does not stall; band0 keeps its measured
   2816  fb37							; wall contribution). Step 4: +6/+8 for the ENAM1 pair, −5 from moving
   2817  fb37							; `inc VcrNext` after the WSYNC — net inside the same window.
   2818  fb37							; SBmask entries = VcrState bit per slice; SBod = bodies per slice
   2819  fb37							; (index 0 = slice0, correct-but-unused: slice0 count comes from the
   2820  fb37							; kernel-entry .Row derive).
   2821  fb37							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2822  fb37				   RowSlice
   2823  fb37		       a6 eb		      ldx	VcrNext
   2824  fb39		       bd 51 fb 	      lda	SBmask,X
   2825  fb3c		       25 ea		      and	VcrState
   2826  fb3e		       f0 02		      beq	.RSopen
   2827  fb40		       a9 ff		      lda	#$ff
   2828  fb42				   .RSopen
