   3304  fda9							;   save/restore round trip deleted (S3.0b — window audit: zero writers).
   3305  fda9							;   Bank1 clobbers $E0-$EF during HUD; VBLANK rebuilds every frame.
   3306  fda9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3307  fda9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3308  fda9							; BuildColupF — MOVED to bank2 (S5.1) — CallPad_BuildColupF.
   3309  fda9							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   3310  fda9							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF6 always
   3311  fda9							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
   3312  fda9							;   The dark check is inlined there too: CallPad_IsRoomDark cannot nest
   3313  fda9							;   from a pad body (ReturnPad switches to bank0 mid-call).
   3314  fda9							;   Body: bank2.asm, pinned at $FC4F. Entry save block ($F0-$F2 → collision
   3315  fda9							;   temps) was dead (rows 0-2 only) — deleted with the .AfterRows restore
   3316  fda9							;   in S3.0b.
