   3505  fe9c							; (every 200 pts); when TallyTicks hits 0 the done path advances the level
   3506  fe9c							; exactly like the old CheckMinerPickup tail, then rejoins OverscanAudio.
   3507  fe9c							;   Event bits in A (through ReturnPad sta/rts): b0 = add 50, b2 = done.
   3508  fe9c							;   Tail mirrors TitleWork: UpdateBombSound holds the coin (BombSnd>0), jet
   3509  fe9c							;   muted, own INTIM wait -> StartFrame: timer block skipped = frozen scene.
   3510  fe9c							; Lives in the $FE8C LHT..moth fill (bank0 has no pre-pad headroom).
   3511  fe9c							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
