   3829  ffec							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3830  ffec							; LaserHitTest — MOVED to bank2 (S5.4, entry tramp $FE86 -> `jmp $FF00`).
   3831  ffec							;   Fold-free: enemy records are level data in bank2 (direct (FetchPtr),Y),
   3832  ffec							;   and the kill/lamp ACTIONS cannot run from a bank2 body (CallPads are
   3833  ffec							;   bank0->bank1 only — pads cannot nest from a pad body). Body returns a
   3834  ffec							;   RESULT CODE in A (+Z preserved through ReturnPad's sta/rts): 0 = miss,
   3835  ffec							;   #$50 = kill (dead bit already set), 1 = lamp. LaserInput's tail does
   3836  ffec							;   `beq / cmp #$50 / jsr CallPad_SetRoomDark | jsr CallPad_AddScore`.
   3837  ffec							;   One less push level too (no fold / no pad call inside the body).
   3838  ffec							;   Full behavior docs moved with the body.
   3839  ffec							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3840  ffec
